tagline = "Plant your feet. Hold the trigger. Never stop."
description = "A frontline control kit: Bulwark repels threats under total immunity, Suppression Barrage shells the surrounding lanes, and Battle Frenzy accelerates piercing fire. Gravity Well gathers packs; Pulse Barrier covers a push. +30 health, +1 armor and -5% speed."
